Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FollowVehicleScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Lead yellow vehicle" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High-speed follow distance and relative velocity toward lead vehicle" ;
    :confidenceScore "0.92"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential rear-end collision due to proximity and speed relative to the lead yellow vehicle.
Severity Score: 0.75